<title>JAPAN: Sekisui Jushi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui Jushi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 28.40		vs	   26.53</p>
<p> Operating	  951    million    vs	  876    million</p>
<p> Current		1.22		vs	    1.21</p>
<p> Net		  808    million    vs	  776    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.51 yen	  vs	   15.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     49 million	  vs	  49 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sekisui Jushi Corp is a resin processor affiliated with Sekisui Chemical Co Ltd.</p>
